--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Data used for evaluation (not redistributed)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

FinanceBench
  Islam, Kannappan, Kiela, Qian, Scherrer, Vidgen. "FinanceBench: A New Benchmark
  for Financial Question Answering" (2023). Dataset: https://huggingface.co/datasets/PatronusAI/financebench
  and https://github.com/patronus-ai/financebench
  Licence: Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International (CC-BY-NC-4.0).
  This repository uses FinanceBench for evaluation only. No question, answer,
  justification or evidence text from the dataset is committed here; results files
  under results/ carry only financebench_id values. The dataset is downloaded to a
  gitignored directory at run time by `secqa data financebench`.

SEC EDGAR
  Filings (10-K, 10-Q), the company ticker file and the XBRL companyfacts API are
  published by the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission and are in the public
  domain as works of the U.S. government. Access follows the SEC fair-access policy
  (declared User-Agent with a contact address, at most 10 requests per second).

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Models
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5 (Beijing Academy of Artificial Intelligence) - MIT licence.
  Downloaded at build time into the `full` container image and at first use by the
  `local` embedder; not vendored in this repository.

OpenAI and Anthropic models are accessed through their public APIs under the
respective vendor terms of service. Model identifiers and list prices used for cost
accounting are recorded in src/secqa/eval/models.yaml with an `as_of` date.

